<p>早上出门前我就约好了小时工<span><span>，</span></span>此时家里已经清理得很干净<span><span>，</span></span>顶上白得晃眼<span><span>，</span></span>让人看着觉得心里一片死寂<span><span>。</span></span></p>
<p><span><span>「</span></span>宝贝<span><span>，</span></span>我有件事儿想跟你说<span><span>，</span></span>你别生气……<span><span>」</span></span>他一脸谄媚地靠近我<span><span>，</span></span>想抱我的手臂<span><span>。</span></span></p>
<p>我觉得很热<span><span>，</span></span>把他推开<span><span>，</span></span>冷静地说<span><span>：</span></span><span><span>「</span></span>有事儿说事儿<span><span>，</span></span>离我远点儿<span><span>，</span></span>很热<span><span>。</span></span><span><span>」</span></span></p>
